#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Scan and remove unused media files from your WordPress site to free "
"up disk space. Deep scans post content, ACF fields, WooCommerce, "
"Elementor, theme files, widgets, and more."
msgstr ""
"Changanua na uondoe faili za midia zisizotumika kwenye tovuti yako "
"ya WordPress ili kutoa nafasi ya diski. Huchanganua kwa kina "
"maudhui, sehemu za ACF, WooCommerce, Elementor, faili za mandhari, "
"wijeti na zaidi."

